OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fat first, dying away through the
OL,7,Fmorning. Sunshine and heavy showers
OL,8,Fpossible in the afternoon, with a risk
OL,9,Fof hail and lightning. Very windy with
OL,10,Fpossible gales along the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe showers dying away
OL,13,Fthrough the evening, with clear skies
OL,14,Fdeveloping. Staying windy, with the
OL,15,Frisk of coastal gales continuing.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA dry start with good spells
OL,18,Fof sunshine and winds easing a little.
OL,19,FSome blustery showers developing by
OL,20,Fthe afternoon, perhaps turning heavy
OL,21,Fat times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
