OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FGenerally fine and dry on Sunday with
OL,7,Flighter winds. Rain and low cloud
OL,8,Fearly on Monday, easing in the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Further rain Tuesday
OL,10,Fmorning, then mostly dry with sunny
OL,11,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
